at","ex":"The judge issued an arrest warrant.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-lodge-an-appeal","en":"to lodge an appeal","fr":"former un appel","ex":"His lawyers lodged an appeal.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-overturn-a-conviction","en":"to overturn a conviction","fr":"annuler une condamnation","ex":"Her conviction was overturned.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-pass-legislation","en":"to pass legislation","fr":"adopter une législation","ex":"Congress passed legislation on AI.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-press-charges","en":"to press charges","fr":"porter plainte (au pénal)","ex":"She decided to press charges.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-raise-a-point-of-law","en":"to raise a point of law","fr":"soulever une question de droit","ex":"The appeal raises a point of law.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-reach-a-settlement","en":"to reach a settlement","fr":"parvenir à un accord","ex":"The parties reached a settlement.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-reach-a-verdict","en":"to reach a verdict","fr":"parvenir à un verdict","ex":"The jury reached a verdict after two days.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-relax-the-rules","en":"to relax the rules","fr":"assouplir les règles","ex":"The rules were relaxed after the crisis.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-return-a-verdict","en":"to return a verdict","fr":"rendre un verdict","ex":"The jury returned a verdict of not guilty.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-rule-against","en":"to rule against","fr":"statuer contre","ex":"The judge ruled against the government.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-rule-in-favour-of","en":"to rule in favour of","fr":"statuer en faveur de","ex":"The court ruled in favour of the claimant.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-seek-damages","en":"to seek damages","fr":"réclamer des dommages et intérêts","ex":"He is seeking damages for libel.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-serve-a-sentence","en":"to serve a sentence","fr":"purger une peine","ex":"She is serving a ten-year sentence.","lv":"C1"},{"id":"to-set-a-precedent","en":"to set a precedent","fr":"créer un précédent","ex":"This ruling sets an important precedent.","lv":"C1"},{"id